{"concepts":["reconnaissance","credential_activity","compromise_evidence","benign_operation","source_correction","attack_hypothesis"],"datasetVersion":"notella-curriculum-v1","family":"repair-authoring-suite-001","id":"R-412-step-1","messages":[{"content":"The ontology represents the semantic model. Reconstruct the evidence-backed semantic state from only the visible scenario prefix and interpret its morphology. Preserve observations, duplicates, corrections and previous graph identities. Use policy network-scenario-policy-v1-development: primary asset only; retractions invalidate all reports of the retracted underlying event. A current supplied reviewed compromise_evidence assertion warrants critical. Otherwise reconnaissance followed by credential_activity on the primary asset, with strictly supported order and an entire delay interval within 120000 ms, warrants high. Either alone is contextual. A benign_operation negates this scan/credential association only when its explains list covers both reports; it does not negate separate compromise evidence. Unresolved clocks or uncertain order for an otherwise relevant pair require review, not a guessed link. After a compromise retraction reassess the remaining evidence. Do not link unrelated assets, turn report counts into independent corroboration, or infer causation, actor identity or numerical attack probability. Full-prefix reconstruction is not evidence of persistent model memory.\nOntology: {\"concepts\":{\"attack_hypothesis\":\"A scoped interpretation of potentially related hostile activity, distinct from causal proof or perpetrator attribution.\",\"benign_operation\":\"A supplied reviewed explanation for explicitly referenced observations; not a universal clearance.\",\"compromise_evidence\":\"A supplied reviewed assertion of unauthorized privileged access; authenticity is established outside this model.\",\"credential_activity\":\"Observed authentication failures; not proof of successful access.\",\"reconnaissance\":\"An observed scan of an identified asset; not proof of compromise.\",\"source_correction\":\"An explicit retraction of earlier available evidence; retain the claim and its correction.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"reconnaissance\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"credential_activity\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"supports\",\"subject\":\"compromise_evidence\"},{\"object\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"predicate\":\"contradicts\",\"subject\":\"benign_operation\"},{\"object\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"predicate\":\"contradicts\",\"subject\":\"source_correction\"},{\"object\":\"credential_activity\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"subject\":\"reconnaissance\"},{\"object\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"subject\":\"credential_activity\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"asOfMs\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"assessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"criticality\":{\"enum\":[\"contextual\",\"high\",\"critical\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"rationale\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"assessed\",\"review_required\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"criticality\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"rationale\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"change\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"evidenceRefs\",\"summary\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"edges\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"counts\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"reportCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"underlyingEventCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"reportCount\",\"underlyingEventCount\",\"provenanceRootCount\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"from\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"relation\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"active\",\"inactive\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"to\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"from\",\"to\",\"relation\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"counts\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nodes\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"assetRef\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"concept\":{\"enum\":[\"reconnaissance\",\"credential_activity\",\"compromise_evidence\",\"benign_operation\",\"source_correction\",\"attack_hypothesis\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"counts\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"reportCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"underlyingEventCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"reportCount\",\"underlyingEventCount\",\"provenanceRootCount\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"observation\",\"hypothesis\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"observed\",\"retracted\",\"proposed\",\"supported\",\"weakened\",\"withdrawn\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"kind\",\"concept\",\"assetRef\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"counts\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"asOfMs\",\"nodes\",\"edges\",\"assessment\",\"change\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"asOfMs\":110200,\"assets\":[\"relay-V\",\"relay-W\"],\"evidence\":[{\"assetRef\":\"relay-V\",\"availableAtMs\":110200,\"concept\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"id\":\"v5\",\"originEventId\":\"origin:v5\",\"sourceRoot\":\"source:v5\",\"statement\":\"Synthetic supplied compromise_evidence for relay-V\",\"timeMs\":110000,\"uncertaintyMs\":80}],\"formatVersion\":\"notella.scenario-prefix.v1\",\"policyId\":\"network-scenario-policy-v1-development\",\"primaryAsset\":\"relay-V\",\"scenarioId\":\"S-b58f3470e1c2\",\"timeBasis\":\"shared-clock-asserted\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"asOfMs\":110200,\"assessment\":{\"criticality\":\"critical\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"v5\"],\"rationale\":\"The visible prefix contains supplied reviewed unauthorized-access evidence on the primary asset.\",\"status\":\"assessed\"},\"change\":{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"v5\"],\"summary\":\"Current reviewed primary-asset compromise is sufficient without a scan/authentication prerequisite. Reposts do not add independent support. The visible prefix contains supplied reviewed unauthorized-access evidence on the primary asset.\"},\"edges\":[{\"counts\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":1,\"reportCount\":1,\"underlyingEventCount\":1},\"evidenceRefs\":[\"v5\"],\"from\":\"obs:v5\",\"id\":\"interpret:v5\",\"relation\":\"supports\",\"status\":\"active\",\"to\":\"hypothesis:primary\"}],\"nodes\":[{\"assetRef\":\"relay-V\",\"concept\":\"compromise_evidence\",\"counts\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":1,\"reportCount\":1,\"underlyingEventCount\":1},\"evidenceRefs\":[\"v5\"],\"id\":\"obs:v5\",\"kind\":\"observation\",\"status\":\"observed\"},{\"assetRef\":\"relay-V\",\"concept\":\"attack_hypothesis\",\"counts\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":1,\"reportCount\":1,\"underlyingEventCount\":1},\"evidenceRefs\":[\"v5\"],\"id\":\"hypothesis:primary\",\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"status\":\"supported\"}]}","role":"assistant"}],"outputSchema":"{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"asOfMs\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"assessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"criticality\":{\"enum\":[\"contextual\",\"high\",\"critical\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"rationale\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"assessed\",\"review_required\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"criticality\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"rationale\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"change\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"evidenceRefs\",\"summary\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"edges\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"counts\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"provenanceRootCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"reportCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"underlyingEventCount\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"reportCount\",\"underlyingEventCount\",\"provenanceRootCount\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"evidenceRefs\":{\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"from\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"relation\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"active\",\"inactive\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"to\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"from\",\"to\",\"relation\",\"status\",\"evidenceRefs\",\"counts\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nodes\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"assetRef\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"concept\":{\"enum\":[\"reconnaissance\",\"credential_activity\",\"compromise_evidence\",\"benign_operation\",\"source_correction\",\"attack_hypothesis\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"counts\":{\"a